{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261027/photo/bkn-20261027143331242-1027_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261027144407\"/><p>事發於民泰街。</p><p>紅磡有人涉嫌行使虛假文書被捕。今晨(27日)8時10分，一名途人報案，指發現一輛私家車停泊在民泰街，懷疑該車輛掛有虛假的泊車證明書。警員接報到場，經初步調查，發現該輛私家車的泊車證明書已經逾期，懷疑其屆滿日期曾經被人修改，遂以涉嫌「行使虛假文書」拘捕姓劉(32歲)男司機，他現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:01:48.329870+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:33:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:18.236148+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:58:44.767885+00:00","content_hash":"eaf8463e50b002b89159f72f0782457dc0f0b4ac036c50e971023751c73804ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:01:48.329870+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}